# clamd reads these inside a Linux container, and its option parser strips
# spaces, tabs and LF from each value but not CR: on a Windows checkout
# (core.autocrlf=true) `TCPSocket 3310<CR>` fails its format check and clamd
# does not start (ClamAV 1.5.0, common/optparser.c). LF on every system.
deploy/clamav/*.conf text eol=lf
